                            <description> Values: 0x0 (FC_DMA): Flow controller is DMA for channel 60x1 (FC_SRC): Flow controller is Source for channel 60x2 (FC_DST): Flow controller is Destination for channel 70x3 (FC_ANY): Flow controller is ANY for channel 6 </description>
                            <bitOffset>14</bitOffset>
