                            <name>CH6_HC_LLP</name>
                            <description> Values: 0x0 (PROGRAMMABLE): Exclude logic to hardcode Channel 6 LLP register to 00x0 (HARDCODED): Hardcode Channel 6 LLP register to 0 </description>
