                            <description> Clear Interrupts. This register is set if any of the interrupts below are active. A read clears the ssi_done_intr, ssi_axie_intr, ssi_spite_intr, ssi_txo_intr, ssi_txu_intr, ssi_rxu_intr, ssi_xrxo_intr, ssi_rxo_intr and the ssi_mst_intr interrupts. Writing to this register has no effect. </description>
                            <bitOffset>0</bitOffset>
                            <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
                            <access>read-only</access>
                        </field>
                        

