                            <description> PLL Feedback divide value。represent M M = M7*128+M6*64+M5*32+M4*16+M3*8+M2*4+M1*2+M0*1 defalt value = 24 clk_out = XIN * M/N/NO 1Mhz &amp;lt;= XIN/N &amp;lt;= 50Mhz 500Mhz &amp;lt;= clo_out * NO &amp;lt;= 1500 Mhz M &amp;gt;=2 , N &amp;gt;= 1 </description>
                            <bitOffset>16</bitOffset>
                            <bitWidth>8</bitWidth>
                            <access>read-write</access>
                            <modifiedWriteValues>
