                            <description> DMA request When all three debug messages A, B, C have been received in the correct order, M_TTCAN output signal m_ttcan_dma_req is activated to trigger a DMA transfer. The Message RAM words holding debug messages A, B, C will not be changed by the M_TTCAN while m_ttcan_dma_req is active </description>
