                        <field>
                            <name>TTCAN_CLKSTOP_ACK</name>
                            <description> clock stop acknowledge When all pending transmission requests have completed, the M_TTCAN waits until bus idle state is detected. Then the M_TTCAN sets then CCCR.INIT to one to prevent any further CAN transfers. Now the M_TTCAN acknowledges that it is ready for power down by setting output signal m_ttcan_clkstop_ack to one </description>
