                            <description>This register makes up the lower 8-bits of a 16-bit, read/write, Low Power Divisor Latch register that contains the baud rate divisor for the UART which must give a baud rate of 115.2K. This is required for SIR Low Power (minimum pulse width) detection at the receiver.</description>
                            
                
